{"steam_appid":1522080,"steam_name":"Jitsu Squad","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1522080/474424/a465474ff72b8b52ffcfdbcdd8066a9e768f1db8/1750998505/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1656069300","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256893322/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1656069300","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/ss_7e6b6a4e6b128019cbb2a3a33632f7667e3f3788.1920x1080.jpg?t=1670606330","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/ss_7489299cee107a07753f19c6bfae468fcda186a5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1670606330","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/ss_5adba0565514ffc19a05435f1ff19fc55b60c9b2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1670606330","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/ss_312a77d61d83b13ed7e258d389f1f541d7fa920e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1670606330","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/ss_74b084350560b650cf63f3cf66476df2e2f7aa8b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1670606330"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/a66b9d4ec79cca23d45b14b14235717b.webp?t=1670606330\" width=612 height=50 /></span><br><br><strong>Jitsu Squad</strong> is a 4 player co-op beat ‘em up with fast-paced cartoony action and wacky chaotic battles! It has the accessibility and classic brawler mechanics of games like <strong>Streets of Rage</strong> and <strong>Final Fight</strong> but with the speed and intensity of fighting games games such as<strong> Marvel vs. Capcom II, Dragonball FighterZ &amp; Super Smash Bros.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/98155c0a52e31e258274cfd3817d11a9.webp?t=1670606330\" width=612 height=50 /></span><br><br>This mode makes it possible to switch between playable characters. You can control the entire Jitsu Squad on a single quest or play with a friend and choose two characters each! The combo possibilities are insane and so satisfying!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/ec5888a2a2b9f59cfe26d9cbf9738ca4.poster.avif?t=1670606330\" width=612 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/ec5888a2a2b9f59cfe26d9cbf9738ca4.webm?t=1670606330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/ec5888a2a2b9f59cfe26d9cbf9738ca4.mp4?t=1670606330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/82311daacc6ab507954ba88472e74079.webp?t=1670606330\" width=612 height=50 /></span><br><br>Collect enough soul orbs and put on your <strong>ULTIMATE ARMOR!</strong> You become invincible and all your attacks and special moves become stronger than ever for a short period of time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/694770c09935ed9658fe4ff11f230c1b.poster.avif?t=1670606330\" width=612 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/694770c09935ed9658fe4ff11f230c1b.webm?t=1670606330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/694770c09935ed9658fe4ff11f230c1b.mp4?t=1670606330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/d438c05d09d168464f59d5997f5d7b75.webp?t=1670606330\" width=612 height=50 /></span><br><br>\t•\tEpic Super Specials!<br>\t•\t500+ chain-combos!<br>\t•\tPowerful in-game character transformations!<br>\t•\tAwesome crossover assist characters!<br>\t•\tRun or Dash! No walking allowed in Jitsu Squad<br>\t•\tA wide variety of unique enemies and stages!<br>\t•\tUp to 4-player co-op fun!<br>\t•\tUnique secondary weapons for each playable character!<br>\t•\tUpgrade system to level up your character!<br>\t•\tInfinite juggles<br>\t•\tParrying/Counters<br>\t•\tTAG TEAM MODE!<br>\t•\tFURY MODE!<br>\t•\tAnd more to come!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/cfc376004f1856e05228a8c9f053be98.poster.avif?t=1670606330\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/cfc376004f1856e05228a8c9f053be98.webm?t=1670606330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522080/extras/cfc376004f1856e05228a8c9f053be98.mp4?t=1670606330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64 bit) or  Newer (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760,  AMD Radeon R9 270X,  or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> -<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> -</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64 bit) or  Newer (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor